		TownNPCMood: {
			Angel: {
				Content: '''I- I'm doing wonderfully, thank you! Of course, i- if you'd like me to, I wouldn't object to...s- studying your internals...'''
				NoHome: '''As...e- exciting as it is to study and experience the various i- ins and outs of the creatures of this world, I wouldn't mind a home to s- stay at in the downtime.'''
				FarFromHome: '''W- wow! I've certainly traveled farther than usual today...wh- what predatory thing could I have been attempting to s- study this far out...?'''
				Biomes: {
					Jungle: '''I LOVE this location! Sure, it's aWfully hot and humid here...but just LOOK at all those hungry predators!~ Oh, I'll be able to do TONS of science with them! Sweet, sizzling, SCALDING science...~'''
					Sky: '''It's always nice to be up in the skies...reminds me a lot of home. O- of course, it also doesn't have any of the complaining whenever I get e- eaten and start my...research.'''
					Forest: '''I'm not sure I like it here. S- sure, it's very calm here, and the locals are nice, but there simply aren't enough things for me to...s- study, as it were.'''
					Corruption: '''As fascinating as the specimens here are, this place is hardly suited for sustained housing! S- still...one must study the fallen to- well, to avoid BECOMING the fallen...a- and the subjects here certainly get the mind m- moving...'''
					Crimson: '''This place is very...g- gorey. That said, the local...wildlife, if you can c- call them that, are certainly eager to...g- get me on my way into them...wh- which I don't mind all that m- much!'''
					Dungeon: '''I DESPISE this place. There's nothing worth studying. There's nothing to even eat me in the first place aside from the slimes. The slimes here are pointless to study, as any information about them could be gleaned from other, more visually-pleasing and scientifically-stimulating slimes. I'd very much like to leave.'''
				}
				Neighbors: {
					CrowdLevel: {
						Alone: '''It's very quiet here. I suppose the solitude isn't AWFUL, but...would you be so kind as to deliver the occasional pred to sweep me off of my feet and onto their figure?...f- for purely scientific p- purposes, of course!'''
						GoodCompany: '''I enjoy the company you've given me. Very amicable, and very willing to further my studies!...a- and give me a comfortable s- sytem to sit in and...e- enjoy myself to.'''
						BadCompany: '''I don't really enjoy the company you've given me. As for why...well, it varies from person to person.'''
						ThreesTheSweetSpot: '''Three is a c- crowd, they say...I- I say three is a healthy s- selection of potential p- predators to work with and analyze!...a- and throw myself into.'''
						ThreesNotTheSweetSpot: '''Three is a crowd, they say. I- I say three WOULD be a healthy selection of potential predators to work with...i- if none of the elements were problematic.'''
						TooCrowded: '''I- is it a valid complaint in the field of g- gastronomy to be suffering from ch- choice paralysis!?'''
					}
					SpecificNPCs: {
						LoveSuccubus: '''Th- the demon lady? Lucinda!? I- I do NOT have...I...oh, who am I kidding? I- I could NEVER be anything less than s- SMITTEN for that b- beautiful body...and that s- strong, searing s- stomach...PERFECT!~'''
						LoveCadence: '''Qu- Queen Cadence? Oh...I- I would look HEAVENLY as p- padding on her rear...a- and I can just imagine her s- stomach...MMMF! O- oh, I want- ...n- no, I NEED her to annex me, YESTERDAY!~'''
						LoveTavernkeep: '''{NPCName}...the tavernk- keeper. Ooohhhhh...j- just LOOK at those arms. Those m- massive, manly muscles...unf, my t- temperature's rising just THINKING about him! I- I can only imagine how s- strong and s- sturdy his s- s- stomach must be...~'''
						LikeNurse: '''{NPCName} is such a wonderful woman, m- making sure everyone is happy, healthy, AND healthily hungry!...p- primarily because they can't really help me with my s- studies if they're too sick to e- eat me.'''
						LikeDryad: '''Dryads are a very fascinating creature from external AND i- internal perspectives, so it should be no surprise that I find {NPCName} particularly fruitful to study!...a- and particularly...a- attractive.'''
						DislikeZoologist: '''B- by all accounts, I should like {NPCName} more than I do. Her s- system...changes dramatically in certain conditions, providing a rare opportunity to s- study two states at once...and yet, it just bothers me. M- maybe it's just because other people's guts are the same experience each time...her b- belly is inconsistent by comparison.'''
						DislikeArmsDealer: '''{NPCName} bothers me slightly. I- it's not even that he doesn't want to eat me, o- or that I don't let him; he's m- MORE than enthusiastic enough, a- and I don't mind studying him! The problem is, he's...n- not my type, but he keeps insisting he is.'''
						DislikeAria: '''Cadence's daughter? U- um...well, she's certainly fascinating...most children are only able to swallow so much as a large grape before their teenage years. Still...I don't feel I should be around her. Th- the inherent...nature of my experiments m- may ultimately upset Cadence if Aria is nearby when they're...p- performed.'''
						CadenceAndAria: '''I- I feel...conflicted. O- on one hand, I'm s- sure I would...g- garner invaluable information...wh- while plumping up C- Cadence's backside. O- on the other hand, as...s- stimulating as Her R- Royal Highnass may b- be to me, I- I'd rather keep my c- composure in the p- presence of her d- daughter. P- please look into a solution.'''
						HateAngler: '''{NPCName}? Oh, that little fisherman's no fun. Too young to eat me, too young to get WHY I want to be eaten so much on any front...and he poses no scientifically significant qualities whatsoever!'''
						Calamity: {
							LikeAmidias: '''Th- that seahorse king is great! He always gives me all sorts of information about the- ...the marine life that once populated his old home! He, himself, is also quite...i- interesting...compared to most I meet!'''
							LikeCirrus: '''It's q- quite fascinating to study Cirrus' internals! Sh- she always drinks so much to chase down her...m- meals, to the point one might think her liver is broken...b- but it's actually stronger than any normal person's! O- of course, she also has...q- quite the...a- appealing figure.'''
							HateCalamitas: '''I once asked the witch to allow me to...s- study her internals for science...aand she threatened to burn me on the spot! Seriously, what did HER boss make her put up with to make her such a k- killjoy!?'''
						}
					}
				}
			}
			Succubus: {
				Content: '''Aside from you not fillin' out my gut right now, I think I'm fine.'''
				NoHome: '''My stomach's a good spot for a mortal morsel like you, but I need a real place to live if I'm gonna feed this gut of mine on the regular.'''
				FarFromHome: '''Well, I've headed off a little far from home today, eh? Then again, it's all worth gettin' the right meal.'''
				Biomes: {
					Ocean: '''It's great to be around the ocean, don'tcha think? Sittin' in the warm sand, lookin' over the sunset as your prey-stuffed gut churns and gurgles even the meatiest meals into more of ya...it's the BEST. My only regret's that I didn't come up here sooner'''
					Desert: '''The desert's nice and warm, I have to say. Reminds me of home, in all the good ways, and it's a lot more open to boot. Plenty of prey to snatch up, too. I like it.'''
					Tundra: '''It's way too cold around here, if you ask me. Food's a bit too fluffy for me, too. I'd kill for a warm lava bath right now; find me one, or at least a warmer place to crash.'''
					Corruption: '''Seriously!? This place is awful! I can't even eat the stuff here; I might get food poisoning from how rotten it all is!'''
					Crimson: '''I think you've officially put my appetite in a coma. Congratulations. I've never looked at a place like this before, and I'd never like to again.'''
					Underworld: '''Home again...honestly, I'm already sick enough of bein' here. Either help me cram at LEAST half of that city into my gut, buildings included, or help me move outta here...again.'''
					Dungeon: '''Look at this place...dark, moody, and not a single guy or gal to snack on in sight. It reminds me of home, in all the worst ways possible.'''
				}
				Neighbors: {
					CrowdLevel: {
						Alone: '''This area is pretty quiet, huh? Nobody to eat around here...but I guess the solitude ain't all that bad. Just be sure to gimme a sexy snack or seven every once in a while, alright?'''
						GoodCompany: '''This area's pretty quiet...but there's still a couple decent snacks around.'''
						BadCompany: '''This area's pretty quiet. Don't really like that, and I don't like the people you've got me with, either.'''
						GoodCrowd: '''I'm lovin' it here...plenty of healthy, mortal meals around to gulp down and get nice and fat off of. You're the best, y'know that?'''
						NeutralCrowd: '''It's a bit crowded here. Some good eats, sure, but you could probably stand to...burn off the fat, if you catch my drift.'''
						BadCrowd: '''Seriously!? You REALLY had to cram me in with all the WORST of this lot!?'''
					}
					SpecificNPCs: {
						LoveAngel: '''Promethia? That cute little angel that loves every chance she can get to cram herself into me? Hah...more like ProMEALthia, if you ask me.'''
						LoveZoologist: '''That busty bimbo of a fox'll look GREAT hangin' off my chest. Mind bringing her over here?~'''
						LikeNurse: '''You know, I think my gut needs a check-up from {NPCName}; it's just DYING to...get to know her a bit better. Think you can get her to find the time to stay on my waist for a while?~'''
						LikeGuide: '''I can't figure out why, but something about the idea of melting {NPCName} down into fat gets me all giddy for some reason.'''
						DislikeStylist: '''That hair stylist, Amber...she's a pretty spicy gal, isn't she? 'Course, that's nothing bad...I like spicy food. What I DON'T like is if that spice means they're not food. She's definitely spicy enough to try and eat me first. Not dumb enough to challenge that.'''
						DislikeAria: '''That little princess, Aria...she's too "pure" for me, if you catch my drift. That, and I'd rather not piss off her mom; could probably mulch me in half a second flat if I did. Might be good to consider separating us.'''
						DislikeCadence: '''Queen Cadence? As great as that blimp-sized booty on her would look blimping up mine instead...she's got a kid, and she's gulped preds way bigger and tougher than me. Don't have a hope in hell of eatin' her, so I'd rather just keep my distance...if you'll let me.'''
						HateAngler: '''If it weren't for the fact that children are way too small to be decent meals, that scrawny little fisherman brat would be padding out my waistline right now. Keep your TRASH off my lawn, got it?'''
						CadenceAndAria: '''I'm really not a fan of where you've got me here. Aria's too young for me to feel comfortable around her, and I think I'm just going to aggravate her mom if I say anything about it. Given I'd rather NOT end up adding to Cadence's ass, could I bother you to lemme stay somewhere else?'''
						HateDryad: '''I'm really close to just using my stomach to solve the problem of {NPCName}'s constant preaching about "purity" and "cleansing". Pompous bitch can't make an ass of herself about my eating habits if she's busy fattening up mine, now, can she?'''
						HateTaxCollector: '''You've already done the impossible twice; once to get me outta that shithole I called home, and once to take down that massive fleshbag from the other edge. Do it a third time and get {NPCName} to either shut the hell up or move out; I'm already more than sick of him.'''
						Calamity: {
							LoveCirrus: '''That royal bombshell, Cirrus? "Lethal alcohol contents" my demonic derrière! Just look at those thick-ass thighs and titanic tankers she hauls around! She'll make some grade-A+ gut fat, y'hear me?'''
							DislikeCalamitas: '''There's bein' an apex predator, and then there's bein a stupid predator. Anyone tryin' to eat that grumpy old witch'll learn pretty fast that they're the latter...and I don't like that. Might scare off my food.'''
							HateAmidias: '''That old seahorse is just no fun at all. Won't let me have any, either. I honestly don't even feel like eating him. He's just...he's THAT kinda guy, y'know? Anyway, move him.'''
						}
					}
				}
			}
			Steampunker: {
				Content: '''I'm jolly good enough, thanks.'''
				Neighbors: {
					SpecificNPCs: {
						LoveCyborg: '''It's quite a good show, having {NPCName} around. The old bucket of bolts and I always have plenty of lovely things to chit and chat about.'''
						LikePainter: '''The painter? Yeah, {NPCName}'s a good sort. Spruces up my works all the time! Plenty nice bloke, he is.'''
						HateMechanic: '''{NPCName}? She can put a sock right in it, for all I care! I'm NOT falling for her gaudy gizmos and gadgets!'''
					}
				}
			}
		}
	}
}